Package: stamp
Title: Reproducible Artifact Store with Sidecars and Version History
Description: Stores 'R' objects with sidecar metadata, including hashes,
    provenance, and primary keys. Keeps an immutable version history and
    removes older versions according to retention policies. Tracks changes
    and dependencies so that analytical outputs remain traceable and
    reproducible across sessions.
Version: 0.1.0
